<h1>Localiser Probe Calibration</h1>
<hr align="center" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="Description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">Localiser Probe Calibration is necessary to maintain a high degree of accuracy.</span></p>
<p class="sub-head">CimCore Probe Calibration</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Run KUBE. Enter</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>System &gt; Hardware Settings</b></i></span><span lang="EN-GB">. Go to Localiser page and press Advanced Settings... button.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="LocaliserPage.JPG" width="551px" height="485px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Press Calibrate button.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="bullet" style="margin-left:36.0pt; text-indent:-18.0pt;"><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="CimCoreAdvanced.JPG" width="312px" height="216px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Following wizard is part of CimCore WinRDS software and complete explanation can be found in its manual.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="bullet" style="margin-left:36.0pt; text-indent:-18.0pt;"><img src="ProbeCalStartPage.JPG" width="520px" height="310px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></p>
<p class="bullet" style="margin-left:36.0pt; text-indent:-18.0pt;">&#160;</p>
<p class="Note" id="P1"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note:</b></span> You can call the probe calibration wizard from the <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>CimCore Arm Utilities</b></span> application.</p>

